# Rewritten after removing bolt.diy from this repo (2026-09-15) — the old version
# inherited from the bolt.diy template had a blanket `*.md` rule (with a growing list of
# `!docs/DAVEAI_*.md` exceptions bolted on) that was silently gitignoring real, never-
# committed DaveAI docs living outside docs/ — deployment/docs/*.md, deployment/authelia/
# README.md, deployment/CLOUDFLARE_SETUP.md, vps/README.md, vps/DAVEAI_FEATURE_AUDIT_*.md,
# vps/DAVEAI_ROUTE_HEALTH_*.md, and vps/services/daveai-subdomain-suite/ACCEPTANCE.md all
# existed on disk but had never once been tracked in git. No blanket markdown rule here now.
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
__pycache__/
*.local

.vscode/*
.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

/.history
/.cache
.env.local
.env

Modelfile
modelfiles
.cursorrules
.qodo

private/

# Local orchestration/lock-manager tool state (task queues, agent locks, event logs from
# an MCP server that writes into whatever directory it's pointed at) — not part of either
# bolt.diy or DaveAI.tech, doesn't belong in this repo's history.
.hermes3d_orchestrator/
